  "_meta": {
    "updatedAt": "2026-09-25",
    "unit": "USD per 1M tokens",
    "notes": [
      "Official pay-as-you-go list prices from each vendor's own API; aggregators and resellers bill their own rates.",
      "cacheCreationPerMtk is the default (5-minute) cache write; vendors without a cache-write price bill it as input.",
      "cacheReadPerMtk equals input where the vendor lists no cached-input price.",
      "Length-tiered models record the first tier; where a model has several rates by mode or time of day (DeepSeek peak/off-peak, Qwen thinking/non-thinking) the higher one is recorded.",
      "All sources are listed in USD; no currency conversion was applied."
    ],
